message: "If you use this register, please cite it as below. To cite a single variety, also give its identifier, for example RICE-BRRI_DHAN29."
type: dataset
title: "Bangladesh Rice Variety Register: officially approved rice varieties, with improved fish strains"
version: 1.2.0
# date-released: YYYY-MM-DD   (to be set by the PI on the day of the release; uncomment then)
